{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111009","id":2868264719,"node_id":"PR_kwDOAO6SJc6q9j8P","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111009","diff_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111009.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/111009.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111009","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111009/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/111009/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/111009/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/statuses/543ae3ba111a66f9452da17787d0154f8d3fd459","number":111009,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"Fix editor resources importing","user":{"login":"quadrimus","id":155298224,"node_id":"U_kgDOCUGpsA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155298224?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus","html_url":"https://github.com/quadrimus","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/quadrimus/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Fixes: https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/111008\r\n\r\n### Scenario\r\n- The current editor scale is 100%.\r\n- A new resource is created, flagged as **scale with editor scale** and reimported.\r\n  - File `.godot/imported/[resource].editor.meta` is created.\r\n- The user change editor scale to 200% and restarts editor.\r\n- The imported editor resource how still original scale, because reimport was not applied.\r\n  -  Timestamp of resource (or its `.import` file) is still the same, so `_is_test_for_reimport_needed` returns `false`.\r\n\r\n<img width=\"1114\" height=\"176\" alt=\"godot\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e02e5233-c327-4a24-a478-192d5c19cf7d\" />\r\n\r\nNote: Same goes for **convert colors with editor theme**.\r\n\r\n### Proposal\r\n- A new file `.godot/imported/.editor.meta` is introduced.\r\n  - This file contains editor scale of the last import of editor resources.\r\n- The file is loaded during `EditorFileSystem::_scan_filesystem` call and used to determine if editor requests different scale.\r\n  - This allows to keep timestamp optimization and flag only editor resources for testing for reimport if needed.","labels":[{"id":73330064,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw3MzMzMDA2NA==","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/bug","name":"bug","description":"","color":"ff6055","default":true,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279096997,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTY5OTc=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/archived","name":"archived","description":"","color":"aaaaaa","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":279098219,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwyNzkwOTgyMTk=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:editor","name":"topic:editor","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null},{"id":890310502,"node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWw4OTAzMTA1MDI=","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/labels/topic:import","name":"topic:import","description":"","color":"ffee88","default":false,"archived_at":null,"arc